      "items": [
        "Mendeleev's predicted elements: Eka-Boron (Scandium), Eka-Aluminium (Gallium), and Eka-Silicon (Germanium) are frequently asked in exams.",
        "Fluorine is the most electronegative element in the periodic table.",
        "Group 18 elements are called Noble/Inert gases and have completely filled valence shells.",
        "Hydrogen shows dual nature, resembling both Group 1 (Alkali Metals) and Group 17 (Halogens)."
